  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating Inclusive Business - Inclusive Business in Asia for inclusive growth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fr&#xE4;mja &amp; underl&#xE4;tta inkluderande f&#xF6;retag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is expected to contribute directly to the reduction of poverty and vulnerability by accelerating business solutions relevant for poor people. The project promotes gender equality through gender-sensitive investment design and impact assessment studies. It also contributes to environmental sustainability by eventually supporting investment projects that create environmental benefits and promote climate change mitigation (e.g, in the area of renewable energy).The intended outcome is increased inclusive business investments in ADB&apos;s development member countries brought about through (i) improvements in the commercial viability, business models, and social impact of inclusive business opportunities; and (ii) enhanced investment climates and ecosystems for inclusive business.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser underl&#xE4;tta f&#xF6;r inkluderande f&#xF6;retag i Asien att       direkt bidra till minskad fattigdom &amp; utsatthet genom                 kapacitetsutveckling av f&#xF6;retag som skapar nya arbetstillf&#xE4;llen f&#xF6;r   m&#xE4;nniskor som lever i fattigdom genom att inkludera dem i sina        v&#xE4;rdekedjor.Projektet ska ocks&#xE5; st&#xF6;dja regeringar &amp; banker att fr&#xE4;mja inkluderande aff&#xE4;rsmodeller &amp; privatsektorledd fattigdomsminskning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will facilitate for inclusive business in Asia in order   to contribute directly to reduction of poverty and vulnerability,     through capacity development to inclusive business models that create new decent jobs for people in poverty by including them into their    value chains. It will also help governments and banks to foster       inclusive business and private sector driven poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
